infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title What to retry — and what not to
  desc Retry conditions matter as much as retry timing
  compares
    - label Retry — transient
      children
        - label 5xx errors
          desc Server-side fault, may recover
        - label Network timeout
          desc Request may not have landed
        - label Connection refused
          desc Downstream momentarily down
        - label 429 Too Many Requests
          desc Honor Retry-After first
    - label Do not retry — permanent
      children
        - label 4xx (except 408 and 429)
          desc Bad request → same 4xx again
        - label 410 Gone
          desc Resource permanently absent
        - label Naive retry-all non-2xx
          desc Storms on permanent client bugs
theme
  palette #10b981 #f43f5e
